# Cross repo pins. One git dependency per line, the repository then the tag it pins. The gate
# checks a movable tag against the remote and the lockfile, so only tag pinned dependencies are
# declared here.
#
# The signing edge qtv-crypto is anchored to an immutable commit, not a tag, so it has no tag to
# drift and is out of this gate's scope. It is pinned by rev in every crate manifest, recorded in
# the committed lockfile, and its source org is gated in deny.toml. For the record it is
# Q-Crypto at 21e28f1ffd1ca46a7144136c483618b18cd29bae, the same rev the SDKs pin.
#
# QRC-CONSENSUS is likewise anchored to an immutable commit rather than a tag, so it is out of the
# tag gate's scope. It is pinned by rev in every crate manifest and recorded in the committed
# lockfile. For the record it is QRC-CONSENSUS at fdee0ee1f9684eeeb1f6cf1ea402f515e87c10b1.
#
# QVM is now anchored to an immutable commit rather than a tag as well, carrying the effects memory
# bound and the access list verification bound. It is pinned by rev in the qtv-node manifest and
# recorded in the committed lockfile. For the record it is QVM at a4b6b42f4c5aeb0104b035f26b26f5bf2430a8ab.
